  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. Dendrogram\n",
    "Ward linkage merges clusters while minimizing increase in within-cluster variance."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 1200x600 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "linked = linkage(X_scaled, method=\"ward\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(12,6))\n",
    "dendrogram(linked, truncate_mode=\"level\", p=5)\n",
    "plt.xlabel(\"Customers / merged clusters\")\n",
    "plt.ylabel(\"Distance\")\n",
    "plt.title(\"Hierarchical Clustering Dendrogram\")\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"../outputs/dendrogram.png\")\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 9. Choosing Number of Clusters (Silhouette Score)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "k=2: silhouette=0.3814\n",
      "k=3: silhouette=0.4589\n",
      "k=4: silhouette=0.3528\n",
      "k=5: silhouette=0.2995\n",
      "k=6: silhouette=0.2946\n",
      "k=7: silhouette=0.2949\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "scores = {}\n",
    "for k in range(2, 8):\n",
    "    model = AgglomerativeClustering(n_clusters=k, metric=\"euclidean\", linkage=\"ward\")\n",
    "    labels = model.fit_predict(X_scaled)\n",
    "    scores[k] = silhouette_score(X_scaled, labels)\n",
    "\n",
    "for k, s in scores.items():\n",
    "    print(f\"k={k}: silhouette={s:.4f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 10. Train Final Agglomerative Model\n",
    "Choose k based on dendrogram + silhouette score + business interpretability (not just the max score)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
